<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>DAGAVOR - Décodeur 237</title>
<style>
body{background:#f0f2f5;font-family:sans-serif;display:flex;justify-content:center;padding:20px}
.card{background:white;padding:25px;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px #0002;max-width:380px;width:100%;text-align:center}
.logo{width:120px;height:120px;background:#0a5c36;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 10px;font-size:60px;border:5px solid #ff8c00}
h2{color:#0a5c36;margin:5px 0} .sub{color:#ff8c00;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:15px}
input{width:90%;padding:13px;border:2px solid #ddd;border-radius:10px;margin:10px 0}
button{padding:13px 25px;background:#0a5c36;color:white;border:0;border-radius:10px;font-weight:bold;width:90%;font-size:16px}
#res{margin-top:15px;background:#ffecec;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;word-break:break-all;display:none;text-align:left}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">
<div class="logo">🛡️</div>
<h2>DAGAVOR</h2>
<div class="sub">- Décodeur 237 -</div>
<p><b>Colle ton SMS MTN / Orange suspect ici :</b></p>
<input id="c" placeholder="Ex: aHR0cHM6Ly9mYWtl...">
<button onclick="decoder()">🔍 Décoder le lien caché</button>
<div id="res"></div>
<p style="font-size:11px;color:#888;margin-top:20px">Anti-arnaque Mobile Money - Yaoundé, Cameroun<br>Ne clique jamais sur un lien douteux.</p>
</div>
<script>
function decoder(){
try{
var t=atob(document.getElementById('c').value);
var d=document.getElementById('res');
d.style.display='block';
d.innerHTML='<b>⚠️ VRAI LIEN CACHÉ :</b><br><a href="'+t+'" target="_blank" style="color:red;font-weight:bold">'+t+'</a><br><br>Si ce n\'est pas mtn.cm ou orange.cm, c\'est une ARNAQUE !';
}catch(e){
var d=document.getElementById('res');
d.style.display='block';
d.innerHTML='❌ Code invalide. Colle tout le code bizarre reçu par SMS.';
}
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
